\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {Copiar os arquivos ARITH2.DLL e ARITH2.HLP \'f3 directorio creado no paso anterior.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\b\f1\fs28\lang1027\langfe3082\langnp1027 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 -\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li360\ri0\nowidctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnb1\pnfs28\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb -}}
\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {P\'f3r en marcha o programa Clic.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\b\f1\fs28\lang1027\langfe3082\langnp1027 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 -\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li360\ri0\nowidctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnb1\pnfs28\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb -}}
\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {Utilizar a opci\'f3n do men\'fa }{\b Arquivos | Nova actividade}{ para crear unha asociaci\'f3n.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\b\f1\fs28\lang1027\langfe3082\langnp1027 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 -\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li360\ri0\nowidctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnb1\pnfs28\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb -}}
\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {Fixar como contido da xanela "A" o tipo }{\b Texto}{ e elixir calquera arquivo da lista. Se non hai ning\'fan arquivo de texto creado, activar o bot\'f3n }{\b Editar contido}{
. Crear un arquivo novo, escribir nel calquera texto (non aparecer\'e1 na actividade) e gardalo d\'e1ndolle calquera nome. Por exemplo, UNTEXTO.TXT.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\b\f1\fs28\lang1027\langfe3082\langnp1027 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 -\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li360\ri0\nowidctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnb1\pnfs28\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb -}}
\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {Elixir o arquivo UNTEXTO.TXT en t\'f3dalas secci\'f3ns de contido da actividade ("Xanela A", " Xanela B" e "Soluci\'f3n \'e1 xanela A").
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\b\f1\fs28\lang1027\langfe3082\langnp1027 \hich\af1\dbch\af0\loch\f1 -\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li360\ri0\nowidctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnb1\pnfs28\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb -}}
\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls1\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {Axustar o n\'famero de casi\'f1as, as mensaxes, o tipo de letra... como se far\'eda con calquera outra actividade de Clic.
